flowchart TB
  accTitle: Nib runtime data flow
  accDescr: Twitch comments feed local actions, minute sentiment, conversation and ten-minute joke candidates. Server-only AI and thumbnail paths produce state and speech for the shared dashboard and transparent OBS Canvas.
  Chat["Twitch chat<br/>Viewer comments"]
  API["Twitch API + image CDN<br/>Server-only authentication"]
  AI["OpenAI Responses API<br/>Text + image input"]

  subgraph SERVER["Node.js server · src/server"]
    Intake["Chat intake<br/>Receive-only IRC<br/>Sanitize / rate-limit"]
    Actions["Local actions<br/>Immediate movement"]
    Emotion["Minute sentiment<br/>60-second chat batch<br/>Scores → Nib form"]
    Talk["Conversation<br/>Replies / questions / polls"]
    Jokes["Visual jokes<br/>10-minute chat window"]
    Frame["TwitchFrame<br/>Delayed stream thumbnail"]
    Policy["Shared AI controls<br/>Budget / rate / concurrency<br/>Validate structured output"]
    SSE["Express + SSE<br/>State / actions / speech"]
    Intake --> Actions
    Intake --> Emotion
    Intake --> Talk
    Intake --> Jokes
    Jokes -->|enqueue image + chat| Talk
    Frame -->|selected questions| Talk
    Frame -->|scheduled joke| Jokes
    Emotion <-->|minute scores| Policy
    Talk <-->|reply + emote| Policy
    Actions --> SSE
    Emotion -->|scores + form| SSE
    Talk -->|speech + poll results| SSE
  end

  Chat --> Intake
  API --> Frame
  Policy <-->|bounded request / validated response| AI
  SSE --> Canvas["Shared Canvas renderer<br/>Actions / evolution / speech"]
  Canvas --> Dashboard["Streamer dashboard<br/>Preview and local controls"]
  Canvas --> OBS["OBS Browser Source<br/>Transparent Nib overlay"]

  classDef external fill:#eaf0fb,stroke:#5277a1,color:#1d334f
  classDef local fill:#edf5e5,stroke:#658451,color:#243c2b
  classDef ai fill:#f1eafb,stroke:#8c6ab0,color:#493361
  classDef output fill:#e5f4ee,stroke:#4d8c75,color:#214b3b
  class Chat,API external
  class AI,Policy ai
  class Intake,Actions,Emotion,Talk,Jokes,Frame,SSE local
  class Canvas,Dashboard,OBS output
